{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read (glance)",
      "id": 10,
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
            "content": "**Left → right:** Node UP? → Mem% (red = host pressure) → crash/OOM signals → **Suspected cause**.\n\n**Problem pods list** shows kube *Warning* events (`BackOff`, `Failed`, `OOMKilled`, …) — that is who is unhealthy and why. K8s often records OOM as **BackOff restarting failed container**, not the string `OOMKilled` (that panel may stay empty).\n\n| Cause | When |\n|-------|------|\n| `vps_unreachable` | Node DOWN |\n| `host_memory_exhaustion` | Mem available **&lt; 15%** |\n| `oom_cascade` | Mem low **and** many crash/OOM signals |\n| `oom_killed` / crash loop | BackOff/OOM with Mem OK (pod limit or app crash) |"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Node up",
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "grafanacloud-prom" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(up{job=\"node\",environment=\"$environment\"}) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "up"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red" },
                "1": { "text": "UP", "color": "green" }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Mem available %",
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 5, "x": 4, "y": 3 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "grafanacloud-prom" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "min(100 * (node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{environment=\"$environment\"} / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{environment=\"$environment\"}))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "mem"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 15 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 25 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Crash / OOM signals (1h)",
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 5, "x": 9, "y": 3 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "grafanacloud-logs" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({environment=\"$environment\",job=\"kubernetes-events\"} |~ \"reason=(BackOff|OOMKilled|Evicted)\" [1h]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "signals",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": { "text": "0", "color": "green" }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 2 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Suspected cause",
      "description": "Heuristic from node up + mem% + OOM count (same codes as Blackbox).",
      "id": 7,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 10, "x": 14, "y": 3 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "grafanacloud-prom" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(\n  (max(up{job=\"node\",environment=\"$environment\"}) or vector(0)) * 100\n  +\n  clamp_max(floor(min(100 * (node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{environment=\"$environment\"} / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{environment=\"$environment\"})) / 15), 1)\n)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "signal"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "range",
              "options": {
                "from": 0,
                "to": 0.5,
                "result": { "text": "vps_unreachable", "color": "purple" }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "range",
              "options": {
                "from": 0.5,
                "to": 100.5,
                "result": { "text": "host_pressure_or_ok — check OOM count", "color": "orange" }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "range",
              "options": {
                "from": 100.5,
                "to": 999,
                "result": { "text": "host_ok — check OOM list for pod limits", "color": "green" }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "text", "value": null }]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Problem pods — which / why (BackOff, Failed, OOMKilled, Evicted…)",
      "description": "Primary list. Read name=, reason=, msg= — e.g. BackOff = crash loop (often after OOM).",
      "id": 8,
      "gridPos": { "h": 11, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 7 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "grafanacloud-logs" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{environment=\"$environment\",job=\"kubernetes-events\"} |~ \"reason=(BackOff|Failed|FailedMount|FailedScheduling|OOMKilled|Evicted|Killing|Unhealthy|Probe)\"",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Host journal (live)",
      "description": "Host Alloy journal. Filter for OOM/kill when present; otherwise shows recent host activity.",
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 18 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "grafanacloud-logs" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{environment=\"$environment\",job=~\"systemd-journal|loki.source.journal.host_logs\"}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Pod container logs (after RBAC fix)",
      "description": "Requires Alloy ClusterRole pods/log. Empty until DaemonSet can read logs.",
      "id": 11,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 18 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "grafanacloud-logs" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{environment=\"$environment\",job=\"kubernetes-pods\"}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "OOM / kill hints (journal + events)",
      "id": 9,
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 26 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "grafanacloud-logs" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{environment=\"$environment\"} |~ \"(?i)OOMKilled|OutOfmemory|oom-kill|Killed process|reason=BackOff\"",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memory available % (context)",
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 32 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "grafanacloud-prom" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * (node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{environment=\"$environment\"} / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{environment=\"$environment\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 15 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 25 }
            ]
          },
          "custom": { "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "line+area" } }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU busy % (context)",
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 32 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "grafanacloud-prom" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 - (avg by (instance) (rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\",environment=\"$environment\"}[5m])) * 100)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent", "min": 0, "max": 100 } }
    }
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["am-blackbox", "vps", "alloy", "oom"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "environment",
        "type": "custom",
        "label": "Environment",
        "query": "nonprod,production",
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": "nonprod", "value": "nonprod" },
        "options": [
          { "selected": true, "text": "nonprod", "value": "nonprod" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "production", "value": "production" }
        ],
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "AM Blackbox — VPS host",
  "uid": "am-blackbox-vps-host",
  "version": 2
}
